      "writtenOn": "2023-02-28T23:47:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Per offline discussion, \n\nIdeally, we want the phone to do a 30 second high duty cycle scanning for TA immediately after BT is turned on and the remote headset can advertise TA at low frequency. \n\nThe phone should only connect to a headset that is advertising TA. \n\n+2 this change to unblock the development, but we should revise this policy.",
